---
import './SellerFAQ.css';
---

<section class="seller-faq">
  <div class="seller-faq-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Questions, answered</p>
    <h2>Seller FAQ</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="seller-faq-list">
    <details open>
      <summary>How do I apply to become a Rumy Cakes seller?</summary>
      <p>Start with the short application below. We'll review your bakery details and follow up with the next steps.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>When do I receive my payout?</summary>
      <p>Payout timing and requirements are confirmed as part of your seller onboarding and agreement.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I offer collection and delivery?</summary>
      <p>Yes. You can set the fulfilment options and service area that suit your bakery.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Are fees the same for every baker?</summary>
      <p>Rates may vary based on your seller agreement, location, and monthly sales volume. We'll always make your applicable rate clear.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
